     1407        bt-cli-grp-out AT ROW 8.71 COL 23 WIDGET-ID 50
     1408        bt-cli-out AT ROW 9.75 COL 23 WIDGET-ID 48
     1409        ed-wth AT ROW 11.88 COL 29.13 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 28
     1410        rs-wth AT ROW 12.88 COL 3 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 34
     1411        bt-wth AT ROW 13.88 COL 15 WIDGET-ID 18
