     1424            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D
     1425            AT COL 1 ROW 1 SCROLLABLE
     1426            BGCOLOR 8 .
     1427   IF NOT THIS-PROCEDURE:PERSISTENT THEN DO:
     1428     MESSAGE "c:\tester\Rls_16_0\rc_160_rus\cmpdir\src\rep\e-wrsttl.w should only be RUN PERSISTENT.":U
     1429             VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR BUTTONS OK.
